{"agency_id": "herenge-a-nuku", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz/post/3lss2qbthqs24", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T16:39:00+00:00", "content": "🚨 #Arrowtown residents and outdoor lovers: Join us on 7 July from 5:30-6:30pm at the Arrowtown Rugby Clubrooms to discuss the future of #Macetown Road. Your voice matters. Learn about new access systems and fees that preserve this iconic landmark for everyone. Don’t miss it. \n#4WD #publicaccess", "content_hash": "b94f7b0f7e308263015021bb644f49ed50e11ae995c4695b54c68c7ce806cc02", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/app.bsky.feed.post/3lss2qbthqs24", "cid": "bafyreiechh6o5gahoi4yidd5oz6e6syjpjlz7pdxga2gznfnqev5nnu5wu", "source_id": "77b1247840c68d26"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [{"alt": "Several 4WDs are parked in the snow beside the river on Macetwon Road. Photo credit: Kevin Marlow, Shotover 4WD Club.", "fullsize": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_fullsize/plain/did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/bafkreiaf367o4ony3qaa5aoy52zv4g56ew6uctl3ytbv4umnw55iecf5x4", "thumb": "https://cdn.bsky.app/img/feed_thumbnail/plain/did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/bafkreiaf367o4ony3qaa5aoy52zv4g56ew6uctl3ytbv4umnw55iecf5x4"}], "original_created_at": "2025-06-30T01:44:51.500Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-06/3lss2qbthqs24.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3lss2qbthqs24", "source_account": "herengaanuku.govt.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz"}
{"agency_id": "herenge-a-nuku", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz/post/3lsiehuh3nc2z", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T16:39:00+00:00", "content": "If you are a landowner, allowing a legal walkway on your land can be straightforward with our simple walkway easement. It lets people walk or ride safely across your farm, forest or land, but only according to the terms you want. 🥾🧑‍🌾\n\nwww.herengaanuku.govt.nz/advice/landh...", "content_hash": "ed1021e79c66f75e4e7c2d70ace3d845edd99809ac4cf95be1896c8f72d1c14b", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/app.bsky.feed.post/3lsiehuh3nc2z", "cid": "bafyreia6avpscp6njz32zumw4axunh6idavvklg2fcejsshp5mt2ayvude", "source_id": "77b1247840c68d26"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-06-26T05:12:29.067Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-06/3lsiehuh3nc2z.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3lsiehuh3nc2z", "source_account": "herengaanuku.govt.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz"}
{"agency_id": "herenge-a-nuku", "canonical_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz/post/3lsaiop7nu22j", "captured_at": "2026-07-01T16:39:00+00:00", "content": "The best places to go star-trekking. 👩‍🚀\n\nMatariki, the public holiday, has been and gone, but #Matariki, the constellation, is still in the sky. Here’s a list of just some of the amazing public outdoor access spots you can walk to see the whetū.  \n\nwww.stuff.co.nz/travel/36072...", "content_hash": "f8f584ba7708df439f155f0d8f5348e3ed07d1ce85397360bebd2b2f95373ddc", "cross_source_ids": {"at_uri": "at://did:plc:mi3fsmvaki4gnknjgt3wpxew/app.bsky.feed.post/3lsaiop7nu22j", "cid": "bafyreigo3kl5kk55amgudt74vnp7ius4lor6ys3sb3oydb6m2byjjce7jy", "source_id": "77b1247840c68d26"}, "extraction_method": "generic_registered_bluesky_public_api", "media_refs": [], "original_created_at": "2025-06-23T02:06:35.528Z", "raw_path": "historical_archive_raw/bluesky/2025-06/3lsaiop7nu22j.json", "record_id": "bluesky:3lsaiop7nu22j", "source_account": "herengaanuku.govt.nz", "source_kind": "social_profile", "source_platform": "bluesky", "source_url": "https://bsky.app/profile/herengaanuku.govt.nz"}
